    "preamble": "Paidipalli Maruthi, Karimnagar Dist. vs P.P., Hyd on 2 December, 2022 Author: G.Radha Rani Bench: G. Radha Rani The Hon'Ble Dr.Justice G. Radha Rani Criminal Revision Case No.123 of 2016 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Revision Case is filed by the petitioner-accused No.2 aggrieved by the Order of the I Additional Judicial Magistrate of First Class at Karimnagar in C.C.No.2052 of 2015 dated 12.12.2015. 2. The seized property appeared to be tobacco and gutka products. The petitioner is seeking the release of stock except gutka packets.",
    "arguments": "His contention is that tobacco does not come under Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
